{"3598370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Earn Your Legacy", "steam_appid": 3598370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Combat with Combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, spells, buffs, passives, and more to create devastating combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/f280c7caaba6fc2be3200eb0a5311eb6.poster.avif?t=1782843372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/f280c7caaba6fc2be3200eb0a5311eb6.webm?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/f280c7caaba6fc2be3200eb0a5311eb6.mp4?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear Up and Head Into the Underworld!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think carefully about your loadout before heading into the crypts. Good loadouts can lead to deep runs filled with loot and XP! Bad loadouts will have you scrambling to find an early exit before meeting an untimely grave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up Your Character!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character, weapons, and spells by spending talent points and finding powerful upgrades in the crypt to amplify your destructive capabilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses to earn legendary loot and unlock new features, such as the forge, where you can upgrade your items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/eec4d3037aebabe4ff02fcdb73678cc0.poster.avif?t=1782843372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/eec4d3037aebabe4ff02fcdb73678cc0.webm?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/eec4d3037aebabe4ff02fcdb73678cc0.mp4?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Power of Friendship!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your buddies with you for a friendly session of slaughtering things, exploring, parkour and sharing loot! Enemies and Loot scale with the amount of players in your party.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when exploring, there are dangerous traps around!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/7de254de43c5f94499da232d93e7c853.poster.avif?t=1782843372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/7de254de43c5f94499da232d93e7c853.webm?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/7de254de43c5f94499da232d93e7c853.mp4?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Your Legacy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of your character's achievements such as chests opened, enemies killed, bosses defeated, levels gained and others add to your Legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, these achievements are converted into Legacy XP, which you can use to permanently increase the strength of all of your current and future characters!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Combat with Combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, spells, buffs, passives, and more to create devastating combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/f280c7caaba6fc2be3200eb0a5311eb6.poster.avif?t=1782843372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/f280c7caaba6fc2be3200eb0a5311eb6.webm?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/f280c7caaba6fc2be3200eb0a5311eb6.mp4?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear Up and Head Into the Underworld!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think carefully about your loadout before heading into the crypts. Good loadouts can lead to deep runs filled with loot and XP! Bad loadouts will have you scrambling to find an early exit before meeting an untimely grave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up Your Character!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character, weapons, and spells by spending talent points and finding powerful upgrades in the crypt to amplify your destructive capabilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses to earn legendary loot and unlock new features, such as the forge, where you can upgrade your items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/eec4d3037aebabe4ff02fcdb73678cc0.poster.avif?t=1782843372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/eec4d3037aebabe4ff02fcdb73678cc0.webm?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/eec4d3037aebabe4ff02fcdb73678cc0.mp4?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Power of Friendship!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your buddies with you for a friendly session of slaughtering things, exploring, parkour and sharing loot! Enemies and Loot scale with the amount of players in your party.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when exploring, there are dangerous traps around!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/7de254de43c5f94499da232d93e7c853.poster.avif?t=1782843372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/7de254de43c5f94499da232d93e7c853.webm?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/extras/7de254de43c5f94499da232d93e7c853.mp4?t=1782843372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Your Legacy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of your character's achievements such as chests opened, enemies killed, bosses defeated, levels gained and others add to your Legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, these achievements are converted into Legacy XP, which you can use to permanently increase the strength of all of your current and future characters!</p>", "short_description": "Earn Your Legacy by yourself or with your friends by slaughtering enemies with flashy combos, finding epic loot and powerful upgrades, parkouring around traps and fighting epic bosses!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/e71400ea9fb9ad5f27917d6726cae51843480f0c/header.jpg?t=1782843372", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598370/03f85d40ef089c9ba7a8c